# Build-time (Vite) environment for the FoodOS.ai site.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Only `VITE_`-prefixed variables reach the browser bundle, and everything here
# IS PUBLIC by design — it ends up in the shipped JavaScript. Never put a
# secret in this file or in any VITE_ variable. Server-side secrets go in
# `.dev.vars` (local) or Cloudflare Pages encrypted variables (deployed).
#
# In Cloudflare Pages these are set as *build* environment variables (plaintext),
# separately for Production and Preview. See docs/runbooks/website-setup.md.

# Turnstile *site* key — public, rendered into the widget.
# Default below is Cloudflare's documented dummy key that always passes, so a
# fresh clone works with no Turnstile account.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY="1x00000000000000000000AA"
